// Precedence and associativity, which a hand-written expression evaluator gets
// wrong quietly: the answer is merely a different number.
// expect: 14
// expect: 2
// expect: 20
// expect: -6
// expect: 1
// expect: 7
println(2 + 3 * 4)
println(10 / 3 - 1)
println((2 + 3) * 4)
println(0 - 6)
println(7 % 3)
println(1 << 2 | 3)
